                <head>25. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On July 5, during his visit to France, Secretary of State Dulles and French
                    President De Gaulle discussed the negotiations regarding the Free Trade Area. A
                    memorandum of their conversation, which took place in Paris at 2:45 p.m. on July
                    5, is printed in Part 2 as <ref target="#d35">Document 35</ref>.</p>
            </div>
